@using Mostlylucid.BotDetection.UI.Dashboard
@* Terminal-state rule (operator directive 2026-08-13): a cold widget renders the
   spinner ONLY while the feed might still land; once the bounded first-paint wait
   has given up (the degraded marker — the gateway compose flap), it renders the
   explicit "data feed unavailable" state. Never an infinite spinner. *@
@if (DashboardWarmingSignal.IsDegraded(Context))
{
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center py-4 text-xs text-base-content/50">
        Data feed unavailable — retrying on next tick
    </div>
}
else
{
    <div class="text-center text-base-content/30 py-12 text-sm">No data in this window</div>
}
